            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#cb2866' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='15'>Purpose/ Description</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>- Performance tracking for Corporate evergreen discount for different country teams to analyse</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>- Refreshes Daily</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#cb2866' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='15'>How to use the dashboard (tabs)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>VShop Sales: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'> Overview of voucher shop sales and redemption essential metrics</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>VShop Redemptions: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Detailed view of voucher shop redemptions by voucher code and country</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>All Voucher Redemptions: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Detailed view of all corporate voucher shop redemptions by voucher code and country in the last 12 months</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>VShop Failed Orders: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Overview of failed voucher shop failed orders with the GMV lost and its reason of failure</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#cb2866' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>POCs</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='11'>Please reach out in #pandata-corporate if there are any issues.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
