    <dashboard name='Metric Definitions'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/Foodora/workbooks/APCorporateDailyVoucherShop_17440823682530/236366?rev=' id='MetricDefinitions' path='/t/Foodora/workbooks/APCorporateDailyVoucherShop_17440823682530' revision='' site='Foodora' />
      <style />
      <size maxheight='1200' maxwidth='1400' minheight='1200' minwidth='1400' preset-index='17' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='98666' id='596' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98730' x='635' y='667'>
          <zone fixed-size='115' h='9583' id='597' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98730' x='635' y='667'>
            <zone fixed-size='215' h='9583' id='164' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='15928' x='635' y='667'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='24'>    foodpanda</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                <format attr='background-color' value='#b00f53' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='9583' id='165' type-v2='text' w='82802' x='16563' y='667'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='22'>   Definitions</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                <format attr='background-color' value='#e6e6e6' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone fixed-size='654' forceUpdate='true' h='55167' id='105' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='98730' x='635' y='10250'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10' underline='true'>Voucher Shop Sales</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>(1) Voucher Shop sales refer to valid voucher orders from the following vendors: </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>- SG Vendor Code h6ph</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>- MY Vendor Code h8at</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>- PH Vendor Code b2gp</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>- PK Vendor Code lnwf</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>- HK Vendor Code p3oi (launched 7 April 2021)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>- TH Vendor Code wdyj</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>- BD Vendor Code mq6q</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>- TW Vendor Code kwd6</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Voucher Shop sales also includes </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#b00f53' fontsize='10'>HK &amp; TW offline voucher sales</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>(2) Expired Unredeemed Vouchers: Vouchers with expiry date during the month</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>(3) Redeemed Vouchers: Valid orders (B2B and B2C) with the relevant voucher codes utilized during the month</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10' underline='true'>Voucher Shop Redemptions / All Corporate Vouchers Redemptions (L12M)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>(1) Expired Unredeemed Vouchers: Vouchers that have expired and unredeemed as of current date</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>(2) Available Vouchers: Vouchers that have not expired and are unredeemed as of current date</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>(3) Expired Unredeemed Voucher Value: Total face value of vouchers that have expired and unredeemed as of current date</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>(4) Available Voucher Value: Total face value of vouchers that have not expired and are unredeemed as of current date</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>(5) Redemption Quantity % = Redeemed Vouchers / Total Quantity</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>(6) Redemption Value EUR % = Redeemed Voucher Value EUR / Total Voucher Value EUR</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>(7) Corp Orders Redemption Quantity % = # Vouchers redeemed for corporate orders / Total Quantity</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>(8) Corp Orders Redemption Value EUR % = Total face value of vouchers redeemed for corporate orders / Total Voucher Value EUR</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>(9) Corp Orders Redemption Value Local % = Total face value of vouchers redeemed for corporate orders / Total Voucher Value Local</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>All Corporate Vouchers Redemptions (L12M) refer to all vouchers tagged under &apos;Corporate&apos; channel in MMT and created in the last 12 months</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='33916' id='598' type-v2='empty' w='98730' x='635' y='65417'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
        </zone>
      </zones>
